 "provenance": "Item.Return from the client's own table/Item. Return = [currencyType, amount]: spending one of the item pays `amount` of the currency whose table/CurrencyType TpyeId == currencyType, and that row's ItemID is the bag item that lands (927 = E_FragmentMoney -> 1237927 神笺, served to the client as BaseInfoProto field 66 FragmentMoney). It is the rate behind the ItemType 12 神格碎片 「转化」 button, which the client cannot render on its own: ItemInfoWnd_OnUseBtnClick (0x16ED7F0) -> BagModule_ItemType2SelectType (0x19BA2E8: ItemType 12 -> 4) -> BagModule_ItemExchangeCurrency (0x19C6688) sends C2L_ItemExchangeCurrency (982) and only draws the RewardData of L2C_ItemExchangeCurrency (983) that comes back. The curated economy_catalog carries this column only for the rows it lists; reward_items.json has no Return column at all, so the whole column is exported here."
